# LF everywhere, including Windows working copies. The build hashes files for
# cache-busting and packs text files into the press archives, so a checkout
# with CRLF endings would build different bytes from CI's and fail the drift
# check for no real reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
